  "content": "<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>FPS 提升</strong></pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1072962/description_4f2caf77-6224-4b4f-a2d3-eae6e388496b.png\" width=\"244\" height=\"244\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>本模组旨在改善您游戏的<span style=\"color:#3598db\">性能</span>和<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">稳定性</span>，并增加了一些选项，例如在特定不活动时间内<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">缩放</span>画面以及降低帧率以<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">节省能源</span>。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>2.0 版本警告：这是代码的全面重构，如果遇到错误，请务必反馈给我们。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://www.minecraft-france.fr/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"396\" height=\"82\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://minecraftfacile.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/logo-forge.jpg\" alt=\"How to install and use Forge in Minecraft (step-by-step) – The Minecrafter\" width=\"398\" height=\"67\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">帮助：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/7qhfqERhS7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://logos-world.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Discord-Logo.png\" alt=\"Discord Logo, symbol, meaning, history, PNG, brand\" width=\"78\" height=\"44\">链接</a></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>有模组与无模组的对比<br></strong></pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">FPS：~91&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; FPS：~120</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1072962/description_956fa9bf-4f16-4e77-bc7b-94266fb4bf6c.png\" width=\"385\" height=\"202\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1072962/description_08506585-42cb-46bb-b023-8d57b8c7ab44.png\" width=\"384\" height=\"202\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>设置</strong></pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">禁用天气</span>：</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;关闭降雨</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">重新加载区块</span>：</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 简单地重新生成已生成的区块</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">慢速刻</span>：</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;减少世界刻数以降低 CPU 消耗</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">禁用实体生成</span>：</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;禁用实体生成（新区块生成时可能会出现实体）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">清理滞后</span>：</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;每 3 分钟移除地面上所有物品</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">实体优化</span>：</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;减少世界中实体的数量</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">显示 FPS</span>：</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;在屏幕顶部显示帧率</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">清理滞后通知</span>：</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;启用或禁用与清理滞后相关的视觉通知</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">屏幕保护程序</span>：</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;当您离开键盘超过一分钟时，将出现屏幕保护程序，以降低计算机的能耗</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#34495e\">缩放</span><span style=\"color:#34495e\">：</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 本模组的缩放功能通过按下 C 键（可修改）实现，比 Optifine 的缩放功能更强大，因为它允许您使用 I 和 O 键修改缩放级别。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">节能模式</span>：</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;此功能允许您在游戏处于后台运行或玩家不活动时降低游戏帧率，从而减少能源消耗，并在后台运行 Minecraft 时提高系统性能</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>⚠️此模组需要依赖项 TCTCore ⚠️</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1064329/description_3fbde43e-996c-4363-83ce-ed278caf2d56.png\" width=\"229\" height=\"229\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tct-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载链接</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>按 H 键进入模组菜单</strong></pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1072962/description_668ecb56-9d8e-485b-81be-aa0f14ea216d.png\" width=\"618\" height=\"318\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>信息<br></strong></pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">⚠️这些模组可以帮助资源有限的玩家节省资源。这是一个简单的辅助模组，配合 Optifine 使用，可以让您充分利用性能优势，获得流畅的游戏体验⚠️</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
